> I use loopback interface to run netperf tests,
> #tc qd add dev lo root pfifo limit 10000
> #ip link
> 1: lo: <LOOPBACK,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 65536 qdisc pfifo state UNKNOWN mode DEFAULT group default qlen 1000
